# Ignore Nested GitHub Repo
**/.git/*

# Ignore python caches
**/__pycache__/

# Ignore build, dist, egg info
**/build/
**/dist/
**/*.egg-info/

# Ignore python virtual environment
**/[Bb]in
**/[Ii]nclude
**/[Ll]ib
**/[Ll]ib64
**/[Ll]ocal
**/[Ss]cripts
**/[Ss]hare
**/pyvenv.cfg

# Ignore any windows executable files
# including malware and toolkits
**/*.exe
